OL,3,GNEWSACartoon illustrates importance of
OL,4,Ainclusivity in schools with autistic
OL,5,Alead character
OL,6,
OL,7,FStarting or returning to school can
OL,8,Fbring a mixture of excitement and
OL,9,Fnerves for any child.
OL,11,FFor children with additional needs,
OL,12,Flike autism, the time may be even more
OL,13,Fdaunting and perhaps fearful.
OL,15,FA new Belfast-made cartoon series aims
OL,16,Fto encourage and empower children in
OL,17,Fclassrooms to be more inclusive and to
OL,18,Fcreate a space for minds of all kinds.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
